OL,3,GNEWSAExtra #1m needed for climbing
OL,4,Atower in doubt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA request for an additional #1.07m to
OL,7,Ffund a city's new climbing tower is in
OL,8,Fdoubt after council officers
OL,9,Frecommended the cash be spent
OL,10,Felsewhere.
OL,12,FNene Park Trust submitted revised plans
OL,13,Fin July for a #6m Lakeside Activity
OL,14,FCentre featuring a 22m (72ft) climbing
OL,15,Ftower.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
