OL,3,GNEWSAExtra #1m needed for climbing
OL,4,Atower in doubt
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, a report due before
OL,7,FPeterborough City Council's cabinet on
OL,8,FThursday said the proposed activity
OL,9,Fwall at Ferry Meadows should not
OL,10,Freceive additional Towns Fund money at
OL,11,Fthis stage, although it could be
OL,12,Freconsidered "if anything changed".
OL,14,FAdrian Oates, director of development
OL,15,Fand partnerships at Nene Park Trust,
OL,16,Fsaid the charity was "very concerned
OL,17,Fand disappointed" by the proposal.
